  "slug": "my-mother",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1448_my-mother.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "Tomorrow is my mother's birthday. She is turning 55. She has an older sister and two younger brothers. She doesn't like coffee, but she loves fruit. She works at a hospital as a doctor. She is busy every day and works long hours. Sometimes she gets off work at 6 p.m., and sometimes not until 10 p.m. She also likes shopping, so she loves going to stores."
  ],
  "english_full": "Tomorrow is my mother's birthday. She is turning 55. She has an older sister and two younger brothers. She doesn't like coffee, but she loves fruit. She works at a hospital as a doctor. She is busy every day and works long hours. Sometimes she gets off work at 6 p.m., and sometimes not until 10 p.m. She also likes shopping, so she loves going to stores.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "За́втра день рожде́ния моей мáмы. Ей исполня́ется 55 лет. У неё ста́ршая сестра́ и два мла́дших брата́. Она́ не любит ко́фе, но лю́бит фру́кты. Она́ рабо́тает в больни́це до́ктором. Она́ за́нята́ ка́ждый день и рабо́тает дли́нные часы́. Иногдá она́ вы́ходит с рабо́ты в 6 часо́в ве́чера, а иногдá не ра́ньше 10 часо́в. Она́ та́кже лю́бит похо́д в магази́ны, поэ́тому она́ лю́бит шопи́нг."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Závtra dénʹ rozhdéniya moey mámy. Éy ispolńayetsya 55 let. U néy stárshaya sestrá i dva mládshikh bratá. Oná ne lyubit kófe, no lýbit frúkty. Oná rabótaet v bolʹnítse dóktором. Oná zányatá kázhdý dénʹ i rabótaet dlínnye chasý. Inogdá oná výkhodit s rabot́y v 6 chasóv véchera, a inogdá ne rán'she 10 chasóv. Oná tákzhe lýbit pokhód v magazíny, póetomu oná lýbit shopíng."
  ],
